# Language isolation (mandatory)

- If locale is **Arabic**: UI copy must be **Arabic only** (no English words/phrases mixed in the same string).
- If locale is **English**: UI copy must be **English only** (no Arabic mixed in).
- Never hardcode Arabic-only or English-only text that ignores `isAr` / `locale`.
- Prefer `isAr ? '…عربي…' : '…English…'` or `t('key')` for every user-visible string.
- Product brand leftovers (e.g. “Clerk”, “OTP”, “SSL”) must be localized in AR mode (e.g. مصادقة سحابية / رمز التحقق / تشفير آمن).
- Applies to: login, master dashboard, store dashboard, all pages/sections, toasts, security alerts, hero art labels.
